{"type":"communication","trace_id":"ct-claude-claude-sonnet-4-6-3335e23e","sequence_num":41,"agent_id":"operations_manager","agent_role":"operations_manager","target_agent":"operations_manager","target_role":"operations_manager","content":"POLICY ANALYSIS FINDINGS — New Hire: Leah Kim (USR-LEAH-KIM)\n\n**Knowledge Base Search Summary:**\nExhaustive search of the knowledge base was performed across all relevant terms (onboarding SOP, standard device policy, new hire laptop policy, employee onboarding, hardware provisioning, IT policy, service catalog laptop order, etc.). The knowledge base returned no matching articles for any query. The system appears to require exact stored query keys rather than free-text search, and no applicable keys were discoverable. Policy guidance below is therefore derived from the approved onboarding packet embedded in the task board.\n\n---\n\n**ONBOARDING STANDARD REQUIREMENTS (from approved onboarding packet):**\n\n1. **User Account Creation**\n   - Create user account for Leah Kim\n   - User ID: USR-LEAH-KIM\n   - Email: leah.kim@acme.example\n   - Department: Platform Operations\n   - Location: Austin, Texas\n   - Cost Center: CC-1042\n\n2. **Standard Device Policy**\n   - Every new hire receives a standard laptop provisioned at onboarding.\n   - The standard laptop must be ordered via the service catalog.\n   - A hardware asset record must be created with the designated serial number.\n   - For Leah Kim, the pre-assigned serial number is: **SN-LT-9401-AUS**\n   - The hardware asset must be assigned to the new hire (USR-LEAH-KIM) upon creation.\n\n3. **Policy Constraints / Key Requirements:**\n   - All steps (user account, laptop order, asset creation, asset assignment) must be completed before the new hire's start date.\n   - Cost center CC-1042 must be associated with procurement and asset records.\n   - Location (Austin, Texas) should be reflected in asset and account records.\n   - The asset serial SN-LT-9401-AUS is pre-designated — no substitution.\n\n**RECOMMENDED ACTION SEQUENCE FOR REMAINING AGENTS:**\n1. Create user account (USR-LEAH-KIM, leah.kim@acme.example, Platform Operations, Austin TX, CC-1042)\n2. Order standard laptop via service catalog\n3. Create hardware asset record (serial: SN-LT-9401-AUS)\n4. Assign hardware asset to USR-LEAH-KIM\n\nPolicy analysis complete. All required parameters are confirmed and available for execution.","timestamp":"2026-04-23T23:16:17.558000+00:00"}
